  id: woodcutterslodge
  displayName: The Woodcutter's Lodge
  description: Tor turns logs into planks while you are away. Give him the Carpenter's work and build the Woodcutter's Lodge he showed you, near the trees ({key:Build}). Palisades, a storage shed and a watch post all start with a plank, and at Tier II his lodge plans a Wainwright's Yard.
  chain: Hands at Home
  journalNotes: Planks, not logs. That is the difference between a camp and a place people stay.
